{"sha": "44f037f5e993b1b42f45799447c21d36c46ca53e54cefd52c6785abf72f4e308", "body": ["\\chapter{分数：比较与加减}\\label{ch:g7:fractions}", "", "六年级已将分数作为份数与精确的商引入", "（见\\cref{ch:g6:fractions}）。本章学习对分数进行\\emph{计算}，", "包括识别相等的分数、比较大小、加减运算——", "目前只讨论分母较为简单的情形，", "一般情形见\\cref{ch:g9:fractions}。", "", "\\section{相等的分数}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[相等的分数]\\label{thm:g7:fractions:equal}", "将分数的分子和分母同乘或同除以同一个非零数，", "分数的值保持不变：", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{a \\times k}{b \\times k} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g7:fractions:equal}", "$\\dfrac{3}{4} = \\dfrac{3 \\times 5}{4 \\times 5} = \\dfrac{15}{20}$，反过来则有", "即 $\\dfrac{42}{30} = \\dfrac{42 \\div 6}{30 \\div 6}", "= \\dfrac{7}{5}$（用 $6$ 约分）。", "", "要判断 $\\dfrac{8}{12}$ 与 $\\dfrac{10}{15}$ 是否相等，", "只需将两者化简：$\\dfrac{8}{12} = \\dfrac{2}{3}$ 且", "$\\dfrac{10}{15} = \\dfrac{2}{3}$ --- 两者相等。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{比较分数的大小}", "", "\\begin{method}[比较两个分数的大小]\\label{met:g7:fractions:compare}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{分母相同}时，比较分子：", "        $\\frac{5}{9} < \\frac{7}{9}$。", "  \\item \\emph{一个分母是另一个的倍数}时，将", "        分母较小的分数改写后再比较：", "        $\\frac{5}{6}$ 与 $\\frac{7}{12}$ 比较：$\\frac56 = \\frac{10}{12} >", "        \\frac{7}{12}$。", "  \\item 若可能，\\emph{与 $1$ 或 $\\frac12$ 比较}：", "        $\\frac{9}{8} > 1 > \\frac{7}{9}$，由此立即判定", "        $\\frac98$ 与 $\\frac79$ 的大小。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*2,0) rectangle (\\i*2+2,1.1);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\fill[omDef!35] (\\i*2+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i*2+1.95,1.05);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (12,1.1);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (12.3,0.55) {$\\frac56$};", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-1.9cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,11} \\draw[omExo] (\\i,0) rectangle (\\i+1,1.1);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,6} \\fill[omThm!35] (\\i+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i+0.95,1.05);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (12,1.1);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (12.3,0.55) {$\\frac{7}{12}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 用双条形图比较 $\\frac56$ 与 $\\frac{7}{12}$：", "将六分之一各切成两半，可得 $\\frac56 = \\frac{10}{12}$，多于", "$\\frac{7}{12}$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{分数的加减}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[同分母分数的加减]\\label{thm:g7:fractions:add}", "分母相同的分数相加（或相减）时，", "分子相加（或相减）即可：", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{d} + \\frac{b}{d} = \\frac{a + b}{d},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{a}{d} - \\frac{b}{d} = \\frac{a - b}{d} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[理由]", "$a$ 份大小为 $\\frac1d$ 的部分与 $b$ 份同样大小的部分合起来，", "共得 $a + b$ 份这样大小的部分。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[分母不同的分数加减]\\label{met:g7:fractions:add}", "当一个分母是另一个的倍数时：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将分母较小的分数改写，使两者分母一致，即", "        都为较大的那个分母（见\\cref{thm:g7:fractions:equal}）；", "  \\item 分子相加或相减；", "  \\item 若可能，化简结果。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g7:fractions:add}", "计算 $\\dfrac{3}{4} + \\dfrac{5}{8}$，分步进行：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $8$ 是 $4$ 的倍数，将", "        $\\dfrac34 = \\dfrac{3 \\times 2}{4 \\times 2} = \\dfrac{6}{8}$；", "  \\item 相加：$\\dfrac{6}{8} + \\dfrac{5}{8} = \\dfrac{11}{8}$；", "  \\item 无需化简，结果为 $\\dfrac{11}{8}$，即\\", "        $1 + \\dfrac38$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "另一例：$2 - \\dfrac{4}{5} = \\dfrac{10}{5} - \\dfrac{4}{5} =", "\\dfrac{6}{5}$（先把整数写成以 $5$ 为分母的分数", "）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[经典陷阱]\\label{ex:g7:fractions:trap}", "$\\dfrac12 + \\dfrac13$ 并不等于 \\emph{不}$\\dfrac{2}{5}$！", "分别把分子与分母相加是错误的——答案 $\\frac25$ 会", "小于 $\\frac12$，而\\emph{加上}一个正数后，", "结果应比 $\\frac12$ 更大，显然荒谬。（正确的和 $\\frac56$ 需要", "以 $6$ 为公分母；一般方法见\\cref{ch:g9:fractions}。）", "\\end{example}", ""]}